WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
PathProbe turns one laptop into a whole network test bench.

2
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:07.600
Simulate DHCP clients, each with its own MAC address

3
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:11.200
and an optional VLAN tag, and watch them bind to your server.

4
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.700
Every bound client answers ARP and ping,

5
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.300
so the device you're testing sees real hosts.

6
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:19.600
Save the whole exchange to a pcapng file for Wireshark.

7
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:24.100
Check link speed, scan the LAN, trace a path, or set a static IP,

8
00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:27.700
all from one command-line tool on Linux and Windows.

9
00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:29.200
Mac is coming soon.

10
00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:31.300
The free tier runs five clients.

11
00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:37.400
Pro is $9.99, one time, for up to 1.000 clients,
QinQ, and saved profiles.

12
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.000
Only test networks you're allowed to test.

13
00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:43.680
Download PathProbe free at getpathprobe.com
